---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Vedant Nipane — Data Scientist & Writer"
  description="Portfolio of Vedant Nipane: data science, machine learning, and engineering work — plus a personal journal of poems and articles."
>
  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span class="eyebrow status-dot"><span class="dot"></span> Open to roles &middot; 2026</span>
      <span class="eyebrow">Hyderabad, IN</span>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1 class="hero-name">Vedant<br/>Nipane<span class="accent-punct">.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">
          Data Scientist <span class="sep">/</span>
          ML Engineer <span class="sep">/</span>
          <span class="accent-word">Occasional Poet</span>
        </p>
        <p class="hero-blurb">
          I spend my days wrangling data into decisions and my evenings
          writing down things that refuse to fit a spreadsheet. Fresh out of
          <strong>IIIT Hyderabad</strong>, with recent time as an
          Associate Data Scientist at <strong>Head Digital Works</strong>.
        </p>

        <ul class="hero-links">
          <li><a href="mailto:vedantlnipane0@gmail.com">Email</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/vedant-nipane-9759991b1/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/VedantNipane" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://medium.com/@lifeisgrey" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Medium</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-photo-col">
        <span class="dither-frame hero-photo">
          <img src="/profile_photo.jpg" alt="Vedant Nipane" width="220" height="220" />
        </span>
        <p class="hero-photo-caption">— portrait, 1&#8239;bit</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ABOUT ============ -->
  <section class="block" id="about">
    <aside class="block-label">
      <span class="num">01</span>
      About
    </aside>
    <div class="block-body">
      <h2>Short version.</h2>
      <p>
        I just wrapped up my B.Tech in Electronics and Communication Engineering
        from <strong>IIIT Hyderabad</strong>. Most recently, I spent a few months
        at Head Digital Works as an Associate Data Scientist &mdash; analyzing
        <strong>5.6+&nbsp;lakh gaming instances</strong> and
        <strong>23+&nbsp;crore</strong> in wagered amounts with Python and SQL,
        and building fraud-detection reports that fed into live business decisions.
      </p>
      <p>
        I like getting my hands dirty across stacks &mdash; ML models one week,
        IoT devices the next, web apps after that. Wins along the way include
        <strong>1st place at the Hyderabad 5G-6G Hackathon</strong> and
        <strong>3rd nationally at India Mobile Congress 2024</strong> for my
        IoT research.
      </p>
      <p>
        My interests span several tech roles, but I&rsquo;m particularly drawn
        to <strong>data science and machine learning</strong> &mdash; turning
        messy data into decisions that matter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ TECH ============ -->
  <section class="block" id="tech">
    <aside class="block-label">
      <span class="num">02</span>
      Tech
    </aside>
    <div class="block-body">
      <h2>Tools of the trade.</h2>
      <dl class="tech-list">
        <div>
          <dt>Languages</dt>
          <dd>Python, SQL, C/C++, MATLAB, Verilog</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Data Science &amp; ML</dt>
          <dd>TensorFlow, Scikit-learn, Pandas, NumPy, MLflow, DVC</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Tools &amp; Platforms</dt>
          <dd>Docker, AWS, Git, PowerBI, MicroStrategy, Jupyter</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>DBs &amp; Frameworks</dt>
          <dd>MySQL, MongoDB, Flask, React, Node.js, Express</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ EXPERIENCE ============ -->
  <section class="block" id="experience">
    <aside class="block-label">
      <span class="num">03</span>
      Experience
    </aside>
    <div class="block-body">
      <h2>Recent work.</h2>

      <article class="job">
        <p class="meta">Jun 2025 &mdash; Sep 2025</p>
        <h3>Associate Data Scientist <span class="job-company">/ Head Digital Works</span></h3>
        <p>
          Product analytics on gaming-platform redeem workflows. Analyzed 5.6+
          lakh game instances and 23+ crore in wagered amounts. Designed feature
          strategies through cohort analysis and built automated fraud-detection
          systems.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="job">
        <p class="meta">May 2023 &mdash; May 2025</p>
        <h3>IoT Researcher <span class="job-company">/ SPCRC, IIIT Hyderabad</span></h3>
        <p>
          Led the &ldquo;Remote Titration&rdquo; project for remote lab access
          using Raspberry Pi, Python, and web tech. 1st at Hyderabad 5G-6G
          Hackathon; 3rd nationally at India Mobile Congress 2024.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ RESUMES ============ -->
  <section class="block" id="resumes">
    <aside class="block-label">
      <span class="num">04</span>
      Resume
    </aside>
    <div class="block-body">
      <h2>Three versions, one person.</h2>
      <p class="muted">Pick whichever fits the role you&rsquo;re hiring for.</p>

      <div class="resume-grid">
        <a class="resume-card" href="/resumes/Vedant_Nipane_DS.pdf" target="_blank">
          <span class="resume-kicker">01 &middot; PDF</span>
          <span class="resume-title">Data Science</span>
          <span class="resume-desc">ML projects, analytics, product insight</span>
          <span class="resume-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="resume-card" href="/resumes/Vedant_Nipane_SDE.pdf" target="_blank">
          <span class="resume-kicker">02 &middot; PDF</span>
          <span class="resume-title">Software Dev</span>
          <span class="resume-desc">Full-stack projects, backend work</span>
          <span class="resume-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="resume-card" href="/resumes/Vedant_Nipane_Embedded.pdf" target="_blank">
          <span class="resume-kicker">03 &middot; PDF</span>
          <span class="resume-title">Embedded</span>
          <span class="resume-desc">IoT, hardware, embedded development</span>
          <span class="resume-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ JOURNAL (inverted) ============ -->
  <section class="block block--invert" id="journal">
    <aside class="block-label">
      <span class="num">05</span>
      Journal
    </aside>
    <div class="block-body">
      <h2>The quieter side.</h2>
      <p class="journal-lead">
        When the numbers are done talking, I come here to write &mdash; poems
        and short articles, kept on purpose without a schedule.
      </p>
      <p class="journal-note">
        <span class="journal-prompt">&rarr;</span> the first entry of this journal is being written.
        Older pieces still live on <a href="https://medium.com/@lifeisgrey" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Medium</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CONTACT ============ -->
  <section class="block" id="contact">
    <aside class="block-label">
      <span class="num">06</span>
      Contact
    </aside>
    <div class="block-body">
      <h2>Say hello.</h2>
      <p class="muted">Hiring, collaboration, or just to say hi.</p>
      <form class="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/mqkrgqzv" method="POST">
        <div class="field-row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required autocomplete="name" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit">Send &rarr;</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* ========= Hero ========= */
  .hero {
    padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .hero-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .status-dot { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .status-dot .dot {
    width: 8px; height: 8px;
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(164, 74, 46, 0.15);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 240px;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .hero-name {
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .accent-punct {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .hero-tagline .sep { color: var(--rule); margin: 0 0.35rem; }
  .accent-word {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .hero-blurb {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 36em;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .hero-links {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .hero-links li + li { border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .hero-links a {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .hero-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    background: var(--bg-soft);
  }

  .hero-photo-col {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-photo img {
    width: 220px;
    height: 220px;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.15);
  }
  .hero-photo-caption {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
  }

  /* ========= Tech ========= */
  .tech-list {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .tech-list > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .tech-list dt {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .tech-list dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  /* ========= Experience ========= */
  .job + .job {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .job h3 {
    margin: 0.3rem 0 0.7rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  .job-company {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ========= Resumes ========= */
  .resume-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .resume-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
    gap: 0.3rem 0.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    transition: border-color 0.15s, transform 0.15s, background 0.15s;
  }
  .resume-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .resume-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }
  .resume-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .resume-arrow {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    align-self: start;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    transition: color 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
  }
  .resume-card:hover .resume-arrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
  .resume-desc {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  /* ========= Journal (inverted) ========= */
  .journal-lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 36em;
  }
  .journal-note {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #b5ad9a;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0 0.25rem 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 40em;
  }
  .journal-prompt { color: var(--accent); margin-right: 0.35rem; }

  /* ========= Contact ========= */
  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .field-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; }
  .field label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }
  .field input, .field textarea {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 0;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .field input:focus, .field textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .contact-form button {
    align-self: flex-start;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 0;
    transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
  }
  .contact-form button:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .muted { color: var(--ink-soft); }

  /* ========= Mobile ========= */
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .hero-photo-col { text-align: left; }
    .hero-photo img { width: 160px; height: 160px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .tech-list > div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.25rem;
      padding: 0.8rem 0;
    }
    .field-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-links {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .hero-links li + li {
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
  }
</style>
